ri), e si ritrova in mano la sua borsetta.  Una volta iniziato il nuovo lavoro con successo, un'amica di lei, lo riconosce come il potenziale ladro e lo denuncia. Ma ormai Claudia si sta invaghendo di Agostino, e lentamente inizia a nascere un sentimento d'amore tra i due giovani. Dopo una serie di peripezie, il film ha il classico happy ending, lasciandoci con l'immagine dei due innamorati felici e insieme."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"A youth who has recently graduated can't find a job. One day he unintentionally snatches a bag from a girl and buys a motorbike with the \"proceeds\" of the theft. Then he begins to work as a mail express courier. At first the girl denounces him then falls in love with him."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a1bcxfB0YX2JUmj2CKzaiFcxlI4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p4T3fR1gDmvCgZiOhCRMwV11fSV.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":193066,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a1bcxfB0YX2JUmj2CKzaiFcxlI4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a1bcxfB0YX2JUmj2CKzaiFcxlI4.jpg","language":"it","width":960,"height":1440},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a1bcxfB0YX2JUmj2CKzaiFcxlI4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a1bcxfB0YX2JUmj2CKzaiFcxlI4.jpg","language":"it","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zUSUfdKOXH4CGhzm6OhIhr13GH6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zUSUfdKOXH4CGhzm6OhIhr13GH6.jpg","language":"it","width":1164,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1BAh